  "title": "dumpcap: Remove \"TCP@\" interface",
  "description": "Reduce dumpcap's attack surface, especially because dumpcap often runs with elevated privileges, particularly on Linux\n\nThis functionality can be easily replicated using tools like nc, ncat, socat, and bash's /dev/tcp and piping to stdin.\n\nFixes #21232\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
